98-16-eng-GB/Venus_Express_pillars.png\"> \n\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\n<section class=\"mission-stats exploring-discovering\">\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n<ul>\n\n<li><b>1<sup>st</sup></b> ESA Venus mission</li>\n\n<li><a href=\"/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Venus_Express/Orbiter_instruments\"><b>7</b></a> instruments</li>\n\n<li><a href=\"/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/Venus_Express/The_spacecraft\"><b>1270</b></a> kg launch mass</li>\n\n<li><a href=\"/Enabling_Support/Operations/Venus_Express_operations\"><b>8</b></a> years of operation</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n\t\n\t<div class=\"dimmer\"></div>\n\t<img class=\"image-bg\" src=\"/var/esa/storage/images/science_exploration/space_science/venus_express/19731144-18-eng-GB/Venus_Express.jpg\" alt=\"Venus Express\">\n</section>\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  \n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n \n\n<section class=\"cards filtered\">\n\t<div class=\"filter-wrapper\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"heading section-heading\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLatest\n\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"filters button-group\">\n\t\t\t<button data-filter=\"\" class=\"btn active\">All</button>\n\t\t\t<button data-filter=\".story\" class=\"btn\">Stories</button>\n\t\t\t<button data-filter=\".video\" class=\"btn\">Videos</button>\n\t\t\t<button data-filter=\".image\" class=\"btn\">Images</button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"grid clearfix\">\n\t\t<div class=\"grid-sizer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n<div class=\"grid-item story\" data-d